  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"代理商-素材管理\"],\"business_line\":[\"代理商\"],\"capability_summary\":\"代理商可以通过此接口将「首发素材」上传视频素材至巨量方舟，上传后「首发素材」即可自动完成保护，保护后系统将根据代理授权范围识别搬运素材生效打压，避免其他方抢夺代理的流量。前置需要先完成整体保护授权，参考详细文档介绍 [「搬运治理-首发保护」说明手册（可对外）](https://bytedance.larkoffice.com/docx/Fpn4dn4ldoAHrmxrCEfcpWO1n8f)。\",\"id\":\"ark.video.upload\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/2/file/video/agent/\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1792582253929536\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"ark.auth.get\",\"path\":\"\",\"reason\":\"需要先完成整体保护授权才能上传素材\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取整体保护授权\"},{\"id\":\"ark.access_token.get\",\"path\":\"\",\"reason\":\"需要先获取授权access_token才能调用此接口\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"}],\"risk_level\":\"medium\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1792582253929536\",\"title\":\"【代理商】上传自产首发素材至方舟（搬运治理）\"}",
